<notes>
This Clan variant is identified as featuring a Mobile HPG array. While the Clans operate an undetermined number of Monolith-class vessels upgraded with their own advanced technologies, the design�s introduction only eight years prior to Operation EXODUS suggests that very few accompanied the original fleet; instead, most were likely constructed later in the Pentagon Worlds or Kerensky Cluster, though a lack of data on homeworld production capacities prevents an accurate estimate of how many have been built since.
</notes>

